note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Static scoreboard hazard checker over encoded sm_121 bytes; successor of omega_bw_hazard.c at omega-mv 60b5d81e,
note except ATOMG with size field 2 or 3, whose Rd and Rb are two registers here (hz_atn) and one in that C
note (gpu/nvidia/checks/README.md, bwhz).
note hz_chk checks c[0..lc) (lc a nonzero multiple of 16, at most 32768: 2048 instructions) into the wire m.
note Decode record, 24 ulong: 0 op, 1 guard, 2 stall, 3 yield, 4 wbar, 5 rbar, 6 wait, 7 var, 8 late,
note 9 nr, 10 nw, 11..15 reads, 16 write, 17 flow (0 next, 1 exit, 2 bra), 18 target (long bits), 19 name id.
note Operand: reg | n << 8 | uniform << 16. Name id 0 is no name; 1..37 number the opcode name strings the C decode sets.
note Check wire m, ulong: 0 insns, 1 reachable, 2 count, 3 bad_pc (long bits); finding i < 256 at 8 + 3i:
note pc, src_pc, kind | reg << 8 | uniform << 16 | release << 24. State at 1024: w 512, r 512,
note hints 512 (wpc | rpc << 32): 1 + the smallest pc of a producer (wpc) or queued late reader (rpc) merged into
note the entry since it was last empty, 0 when it is empty; the join keeps the smaller, so src_pc does not depend
note on the order the walk visits successors. Records at 2560, then seen n, queued n, work n, IN states n x 1536.
note m is ulong 3203584 = 2560 + 1563 * 2048; the unit zeroes the used part. A walk longer than 999999 pops traps 4.
note Barrier 6 does not exist on sm_121 (0..5, 7 = none): hz_dec1 refuses it in either field, as the C does, so
note every shift amount below is at most 63.
note Portable two's-complement reinterpretation; the bridge lowers no integer-to-integer bitcast.
fn hz_u2l x ulong to long
if lt x ulong 9223372036854775808
ret long x
end
ret sub long -1 long xor x ulong 18446744073709551615
end
fn hz_l2u v long to ulong
if ge v long 0
ret ulong v
end
ret xor ulong sub long -1 v ulong 18446744073709551615
end
fn hz_u2i x ulong to long
if lt x ulong 2147483648
ret long x
end
ret sub long x 4294967296
end
fn hz_rd32 c view uchar 16 o ulong to ulong
a = ulong get c o
a = or a shl ulong get c add o 1 8
a = or a shl ulong get c add o 2 16
ret or a shl ulong get c add o 3 24
end
fn hz_size w2 ulong to long
s = and shr w2 9 7
